      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRUNCHY TUNA (4) hit her peak third-up when she came from only spot lower to score a 1.2m win in her heat at this circuit and distance. Race fit and is best drawn of the main fancies so could deliver again. FIT AND READY (7) is racing well, winning two back at this circuit and distance before working and sticking on for second in her heat. The wide draw means she may have to do it the hard way again but she is capable. A second line draw presents a new challenge to JEWEL REASON (10) but she is in a purple patch of form, taking advantage of the ace draw to win her last two outings at this circuit and distance. WALK WITH ELEGANCE (9) made progress when runner-up to CRUNCHY TUNA last week. Should be further improved third-up and draws for a trail so could be dangerous.",
